m-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">500 - 1000 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">500 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"consumable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Consumable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.00<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">June 26, 2007<br/>Summer Update 2007</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20170904191017&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Berserk_Potion_e52250.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a berserk potion.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 2.00 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">Drinking this potion temporarily increases your fighting skill while decreasing your defense.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>It increases your Melee skills (Sword, Axe and Club) by 5 each, and decreases your Shielding skill by 10 points for 10 minutes. It does not increase your fist skill and it can only be used by <a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knights</a>.<br/>\n<b>Note:</b> It will negate any fighting skill boost such as Enchant Party, Blood Rage or <a href=\"#/wiki/Veggie%20Casserole\">Veggie Casserole</a>. Be careful - there is a 1-2 second delay for drinking this, therefore you can easily waste a potion instead of using the intended one. It does not matter if you drink 1 or 100 at once; there will be no extra bonuses.\nCan be obtained in the <a href=\"#/quest/berserk-potion-quest\">Berserk Potion Quest</a>, <a href=\"#/quest/the-new-frontier-quest\">The New Frontier Quest</a>, <a href=\"#/quest/waterskin-of-mead-quest\">Waterskin of Mead Quest</a>, and the <a href=\"#/quest/rise-of-devovorga\">Rise of Devovorga</a>. Can also be obtained from <a href=\"#/wiki/Gnomish%20Supply%20Package\">Gnomish Supply Packages</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Alptramun\">Alptramun</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Annihilon\">Annihilon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bakragore\">Bakragore</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bloodback\">Bloodback</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Boogy\">Boogy</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Brain%20Head\">Brain Head</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Chagorz\">Chagorz</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Count%20Vlarkorth\">Count Vlarkorth</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Darkfang\">Darkfang</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Drume\">Drume</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Duke%20Krule\">Duke Krule</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Earl%20Osam\">Earl Osam</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Flameborn\">Flameborn</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ghazbaran\">Ghazbaran</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ghulosh\">Ghulosh</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gorzindel\">Gorzindel</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Goshnar%27s%20Cruelty\">Goshnar's Cruelty</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Goshnar%27s%20Greed\">Goshnar's Greed</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Goshnar%27s%20Hatred\">Goshnar's Hatred</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Goshnar%27s%20Malice\">Goshnar's Malice</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Goshnar%27s%20Megalomania\">Goshnar's Megalomania</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Goshnar%27s%20Spite\">Goshnar's Spite</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hellspawn\">Hellspawn</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hemming\">Hemming<